@startuml use_case_diagram

left to right direction

actor User

rectangle "GitHub Workflow Manager" {

  package "Interactive Mode" {
    usecase "Launch interactive menu"  as UI
    usecase "Add workflow run"         as I_ADD
    usecase "List all runs"            as I_LIST
    usecase "Get run detail"           as I_DETAIL
    usecase "Check run state"          as I_STATE
    usecase "Filter runs"              as I_FILTER
    usecase "Filter by branch"         as I_FBRANCH
    usecase "Filter by status"         as I_FSTATUS
    usecase "Filter by conclusion"     as I_FCONCL
    usecase "Create attempt"           as I_CREATE_ATT
    usecase "List attempts for run"    as I_LIST_ATT
    usecase "Query runs (advanced)"    as I_QUERY
    usecase "Filter by duration"       as I_FDUR
    usecase "Filter by timestamp"      as I_FTSMP
    usecase "Filter by attempt presence" as I_FATT
    usecase "View statistics"          as I_STATS
    usecase "Fetch from GitHub"        as I_FETCH
    usecase "Exit application"         as I_EXIT
  }

  package "Command-line Mode" {
    usecase "Run one-shot CLI command" as CLI
    usecase "Add workflow run"         as C_ADD
    usecase "List runs"                as C_LIST
    usecase "Get run detail"           as C_DETAIL
    usecase "Check run state"          as C_STATE
    usecase "Filter by branch"         as C_FBRANCH
    usecase "Filter by status"         as C_FSTATUS
    usecase "Filter by conclusion"     as C_FCONCL
    usecase "Create attempt"           as C_CREATE_ATT
    usecase "List attempts for run"    as C_LIST_ATT
    usecase "Query runs (advanced)"    as C_QUERY
    usecase "Filter by duration"       as C_FDUR
    usecase "Filter by timestamp"      as C_FTSMP
    usecase "Filter by attempt presence" as C_FATT
    usecase "View statistics"          as C_STATS
    usecase "Fetch from GitHub"        as C_FETCH
  }
}

User --> UI
User --> CLI

UI --> I_ADD
UI --> I_LIST
UI --> I_DETAIL
UI --> I_STATE
UI --> I_FILTER
